  m_text: 'you are immersed in an exciting adventure where your reaction and agility
    will be key factors on the way to victory! Swipe left and right to avoid various
    obstacles that appear on your way. Collect sparkling stars and balls that will
    help you in the bonus game!

    The goal of the game: Reach the finish line
    by collecting as many balls as possible. Be careful - if you hit an obstacle
    and you have no collected balls left, the game is over!

    - Exciting gameplay
    with simple controls.

    - Bright graphics and dynamic levels.

    - Various
    obstacles that require quick reactions.

    - Bonus game where you can use
    the collected balls to get additional prizes.'
